    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In Framing, our company's will define the project scope, goals, and deliverables, and establish a joint steering committee with the client to ensure effective governance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Design phase will focus on designing the AI assistance solution, including the development of a detailed functional specification and a technical architecture that meets the client's requirements for integration with the client's existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI). a pilot phase will involve deploying the AI assistance solution in a limited perimeter, such as one or two departments, to test the AI assistance solution effectiveness and identify areas for improvement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In Generalisation, our company's will progressively rollout the AI assistance solution to all services, providing change-management support and staff training to ensure a smooth transition." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, in Run, our company's will provide ongoing maintenance and support to ensure the AI assistance solution continues to meet the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure successful project coordination and governance, our company's will establish a single point of contact, a project director, who will be accountable for the project delivery and will serve as the client's primary interface. our company's will also maintain a RACI matrix to clearly define roles and responsibilities, and establish a documented escalation path in case of issues or concerns. our company's experience in delivering similar projects to public sector clients, such as the regional hospital group, will enable our company's to effectively manage the project budget and ensure that annual operating costs remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's available capacity, including a dedicated team with the necessary skills and expertise, our company's are confident that our company's can deliver the project within the allocated budget of 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds, 24/7 availability, API integration with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU, and no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED or NOT COVERED by our current technical stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirements can be addressed as follows:  Response times below 2 seconds are FULLY COVERED by our current technical stack, as our platform has a median latency of 1.3 seconds and common queries have a p95 latency below 2 seconds. 24/7 availability is FULLY COVERED, given that our solution operates 24/7 on the appropriate hosting tier with an availability target of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI) is FULLY COVERED through standard connectors and custom adapters for sih_dpi_integration and health interoperability standards like FHIR and HL7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU is FULLY COVERED, as our hosting option includes the Sovereign HDS tier provided by OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and operates within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers is PARTIALLY COVERED because while our offer a sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, our model options also include top-tier proprietary models accessed via API operated by non-European providers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To fully meet this requirement, our could propose using only the sovereign European open-weight model." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would be based on our Atelier platform, with only the sovereign European open-weight model, hosted on OuraneCloud Sovereign HDS tier, and integrated with the hospital's SIH and DPI through APIs, ensuring low latency, high availability, and data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU-only, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification for infrastructure hosting the solution, and explainability and traceability for recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key security and compliance risks associated with this project, and how can we mitigate the key security and compliance risks associated with this project to ensure regulatory compliance?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, we have experience delivering GDPR-compliant solutions, including processing special-category health data as per Article 9 of GDPR. we hold ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers development, delivery, and operations, and also have ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management extension. we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud-qualified and holds HDS certification, ensuring compliance with French health-data hosting requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate key security and compliance risks associated with this project, we will ensure that all data is hosted within EU-only, using we EU-only infrastructure for key management, and implementing encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and at rest using AES-256. we will also apply pseudonymisation where relevant and maintain strict tenant isolation between client corpora. we secure software development lifecycle includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external CREST-equivalent provider. we have defined remediation SLAs for vulnerability management and incident response procedures in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explainability and traceability, our product, Atelier, is designed to provide grounded-in-sources retrieval traces and supports a posteriori review, ensuring that recommendations or suggestions can be understood and audited. our also maintain an audit log and support medical confidentiality and traceability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further mitigate risks, our will ensure segregation of duties between development and production operations, maintain a data processing register, and have a Data Protection Officer appointed. our data protection agreement is aligned with GDPR Article 28, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing security controls, certifications, and experience in delivering compliant solutions, we can effectively mitigate key security and compliance risks associated with this project and ensure regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance, French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, and explainability and traceability for recommendations or suggestions produced by the solution. the solution must be designed as an assistance tool, with no clinical or medico-administrative decision automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key legal risks associated with this project, and how can we ensure compliance with relevant regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act) and contractual requirements? the key legal risks associated with this project include ensuring GDPR compliance, particularly for special-category health data, maintaining medical confidentiality, and adhering to the HDS framework." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, there's a risk related to the explainability and traceability of the AI system's outputs, as required by both the client and EU AI Act." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate the key legal risks associated with this project, we must guarantee that we solution handles personal and health data in strict compliance with GDPR requirements, including Art. 9 for special-category data and Art. 28 for processing agreements. we should ensure that we infrastructure holds the necessary HDS certification for hosting health data in France. we Atelier platform is proprietary software owned by Faber IA, licensed to the client under a subscription model. we use permissive open-source licenses for components and provide an SBOM to the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI models, we utilize a sovereign European open-weight model under a sovereign European open-weight model open-weight license and access any proprietary third-party models under commercial licenses with documented terms." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we experience with GDPR compliance, including Art. 9 for special-category data and Art. 28 processing agreements, as well as medical confidentiality, the HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for health contexts, we are well-positioned to navigate these regulatory demands." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is essential to ensure that the solution remains a non-decisional support tool, with no clinical or medico-administrative decisions automated without explicit validation by qualified professionals. ensure will help avoid any implications related to medical device qualification (CE marking/MDR), although we Legal function can flag any use case approaching medical device qualification (CE marking/MDR) and address the consequences for liability and positioning accordingly. we also have professional liability insurance covering up to 10,000,000 euros per claim and general civil liability cover." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Certificates of insurance are available upon request, which will be important in contractual negotiations and ensuring we meet the client's requirements for risk management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing regulatory compliance framework, maintained by we Security & Compliance function, particularly for health deployments, and adhering strictly to the guidelines set forth by relevant authorities (such as GDPR, the HDS framework, and EU AI Act), we can effectively manage legal risks associated with this project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is 900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Annual operating costs must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model and current financial position, what is our projected margin on this contract, and are there cost-optimisation strategies our can propose to optimise costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service? our target gross margin percentage ranges from 25% to 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client's budget of 900,000 over 5 years, our projected revenue for this contract would be within this budget envelope." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs and ensure our can deliver the expected quality of service while maintaining Our target gross margin percentage, our would focus on cost-efficient tiers and models in our solution design, particularly in hosting and inference, which are identified as main recurring cost drivers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As noted in our budget envelope context, the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By favoring the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model where requirements allow, our can maintain Our target gross margin percentage while keeping costs under control for the client.  our commercial posture is to favor configurations that protect the gross margin and recurring-cost predictability, which aligns with proposing cost-efficient solutions that meet the client's needs without compromising on quality or exceeding the client's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an AI solution that assists staff in staff daily activities, facilitating access to information, improving the quality of written outputs, and reducing processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide response times compatible with daily clinical use and a high level of answer relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key AI-related requirements for this project, and how can we design an innovative AI solution that meets the key AI-related requirements for this project while ensuring explainability and traceability?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client request aligns with we capabilities as an AI & Innovation agent at Faber IA. the key AI-related requirements for this project include providing retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to facilitate access to information, improving the quality of written outputs through template-guided drafting, and reducing processing and documentation times by surfacing relevant information and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design an innovative AI solution that meets the key AI-related requirements for this project, we can leverage we hybrid retrieval approach, which combines lexical and semantic search to provide accurate and relevant results. we re-ranking and query reformulation capabilities will also help ensure that the solution provides a high level of answer relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we multi-document synthesis capability will enable the solution to generate coherent and contextually appropriate responses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client concerns about explainability and traceability, we can provide source citations, retrieved passages, and retrieval traces for every interaction. we human oversight feature, which involves professional validation of proposed outputs, will also help ensure that the solution remains transparent and accountable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, we logging mechanism will enable a posteriori audit of all interactions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific design elements, we can propose a sovereign European open-weight model, which is fully auditable and well-suited to explainability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements. a sovereign European open-weight model, which is fully auditable and well-suited to explainability-driven and sovereignty-driven requirements will be integrated into the client's existing work environment and tools, avoiding disruption to clinical or administrative workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By fitting into existing practices, the solution will provide an efficient and effective way to support staff in staff daily activities while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements and maintaining data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems and reduce energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must rely on low-carbon infrastructure as far as possible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What are the key sustainability requirements for this project, and how can we propose a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and minimises environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requirement for limiting environmental footprint and reducing energy consumption aligns with we capabilities in green hosting and digital sobriety practices. we have a partnership with OuraneCloud, an EU-based green hosting partner that uses renewable energy, has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, and reuses heat." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This infrastructure can support The client need for low-carbon hosting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
